{
  "sourceLanguage": "ja",
  "strings": {
    "%1$@ の 設定 → Ethernet → IP を構成 → 手動 で、IP アドレスを %2$@、サブネットマスクを %3$@ にしてください。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "In the %1$@'s Settings → Ethernet → Configure IP → Manual, set the IP address to %2$@ and the subnet mask to %3$@."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@   %.1f MB   約%@点": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@   %.1f MB   ~%@ points"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@  %.0fk点/s": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@  %.0fk pts/s"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ に送信中…": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sending to %@…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ の有線 LAN": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ wired LAN"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@点  PCD保存できます": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ points · ready to save PCD"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@点%@   %.1f × %.1f × %.1f m   %@   %dms": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ points%@   %.1f × %.1f × %.1f m   %@   %d ms"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%d:%02d   %@点": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%d:%02d   %@ points"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "1スキャンあたりのカルマンフィルタ更新の最大反復回数です。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Maximum Kalman filter update iterations per scan."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "1本指: 回転   2本指: 移動   ピンチ: ズーム   ダブルタップ: 全体表示": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "1 finger: rotate   2 fingers: pan   pinch: zoom   double tap: fit"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "1本指: 回転   2本指: 移動   ピンチ: ズーム   ダブルタップ: 追従": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "1 finger: rotate   2 fingers: pan   pinch: zoom   double tap: follow"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ethernet 未接続": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No Ethernet"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ethernet待機中…": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Waiting for Ethernet…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ethernet接続": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ethernet connected"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "IMU から見た LiDAR 原点の位置です。Mid-360 の内蔵 IMU なら規定値のままで構いません。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Position of the LiDAR origin seen from the IMU. Keep the defaults for the Mid-360's built-in IMU."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "IMU を初期化中…": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Initializing the IMU…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "IP アドレスと送信先": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "IP Address and Destination"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "IP アドレスの形式が正しくありません: %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Invalid IP address: %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "LiDAR のノイズ": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "LiDAR noise"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "LiDAR の取り付け位置（IMU 座標系）": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "LiDAR position (IMU frame)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "LiDAR 受信なし": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No LiDAR data"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "LiDAR 待機中（設定からデモを試せます）": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Waiting for LiDAR (try the demo in Settings)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "LiDAR-IMU オドメトリは FAST-LIO（W. Xu, F. Zhang, RA-L 2021）の定式化に沿った独自実装です。Mid-360 との通信は公開されているプロトコルを独自に実装しており、Livox SDK は使っていません。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The LiDAR-inertial odometry is an independent implementation following the FAST-LIO formulation (W. Xu, F. Zhang, RA-L 2021). Communication with the Mid-360 is an independent implementation of its published protocol and does not use the Livox SDK."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Livox Mid-360 を有線 LAN でつなぎ、その場で 3D マップの作成と自己位置推定を行います。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Connect a Livox Mid-360 over wired Ethernet to build 3D maps and localize on the spot."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Mid-360 からの応答を解釈できませんでした。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Could not understand the response from the Mid-360."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Mid-360 から応答がありません。Mid-360 の IP が正しいか、%@ の IP が Mid-360 と同じサブネットにあるかを確認してください。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No response from the Mid-360. Check that its IP address is correct and that the %@'s IP is on the same subnet as the Mid-360."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Mid-360 がなくても、部屋をスキャンしながら歩く様子を再現した疑似データで、ライブ表示・マップ作成・PCD保存・自己位置推定を試せます。オンの間は実機からのデータと混ざるので、実機を使うときはオフにしてください。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Try live view, mapping, PCD saving and localization without a Mid-360, using simulated data of someone walking through a room. While this is on, it mixes with data from a real sensor, so turn it off when using real hardware."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Mid-360 が設定を受け付けませんでした（ret_code 0x%02X, key 0x%04X）": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The Mid-360 rejected the settings (ret_code 0x%02X, key 0x%04X)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Mid-360 と送信先に同じ IP は使えません。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The Mid-360 and the destination cannot use the same IP."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Mid-360 に書き込む": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Write to Mid-360"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Mid-360 の IP を変えると、書き込み後に Mid-360 が再起動します（十数秒）。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Changing the Mid-360's IP restarts the Mid-360 after writing (takes 10–20 seconds)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Mid-360 の IP アドレス": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mid-360 IP address"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Mid-360 の IP アドレスや、点群の送り先（この %@ の IP）を確認・変更します。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "View or change the Mid-360's IP address and where it sends its data (this %@'s IP)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Mid-360 のネットワーク": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mid-360 Network"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Mid-360 の設定を変更しますか？": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Change the Mid-360 settings?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Mid-360: %@ → %@\n送信先: %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mid-360: %@ → %@\nDestination: %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "NDT の格子サイズ": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "NDT voxel size"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "NDTマップを作れませんでした": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Could not build the NDT map"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "PCD や rosbag を PC やサーバーに SFTP で送ります。送信は PCD ビューア・rosbag の一覧から行います。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Send PCDs and rosbags to a PC or server over SFTP, from the PCD viewer and rosbag lists."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "PCD ビューア": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "PCD Viewer"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "PCD保存": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Save PCD"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ROS 2 (MCAP)：/livox/imu（sensor_msgs/Imu）と /livox/lidar（sensor_msgs/PointCloud2、点ごとのタイムスタンプ付き）を記録します。ros2 bag play や Foxglove でそのまま開けます。\n生パケット：Mid-360 の UDP パケットをそのまま保存します。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ROS 2 (MCAP): records /livox/imu (sensor_msgs/Imu) and /livox/lidar (sensor_msgs/PointCloud2 with per-point timestamps). Opens directly in ros2 bag play and Foxglove.\nRaw packets: saves the Mid-360's UDP packets as they are."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "SFTP で送信": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Send via SFTP"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "SFTP 設定でキーペアを作成し、公開鍵をサーバーに登録してください。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Create a key pair in the SFTP settings and register the public key on the server."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "SFTP 設定でコピーした公開鍵をサーバーに登録してください。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Register the public key copied in the SFTP settings on the server."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "rosbag %.0f%%   %@点": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "rosbag %.0f%%   %@ pts"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "rosbag から SLAM するときの再生速度です。速くすると処理が追いつかずスキャンを捨てることがあります。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Playback speed when running SLAM from a rosbag. When faster, processing may fall behind and drop scans."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "rosbag がありません。\n「● 記録」で保存するか、PC などで ros2 bag record した MCAP ファイルを「ファイルを開く」で取り込んでください。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No rosbags yet.\nRecord one with \"● Record\", or import an MCAP file made with ros2 bag record via \"Open File\"."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "rosbag の再生が終わりました": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Finished playing the rosbag"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "rosbag の再生エラー: %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "rosbag playback error: %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "rosbag を読めません: %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cannot read the rosbag: %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "rosbag を選択": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Choose a rosbag"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "rosbag 保存: %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "rosbag saved: %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "rosbag: %1$@ + %2$@  開始を押すと再生します": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "rosbag: %1$@ + %2$@  Press Start to play"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "rosbag: 開始を押すと再生します": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "rosbag: press Start to play"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "■  停止": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "■  Stop"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "▶  マップ作成 開始": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "▶  Start Mapping"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "▶  自己位置推定 開始": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "▶  Start Localization"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "● 記録": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "● Record"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "いまの Mid-360 の IP です。点群を受信中なら自動で入ります。%@ の IP がこのアドレスと同じサブネットにないと設定できません。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The Mid-360's current IP. Filled in automatically while point data is coming in. The %@'s IP must be on the same subnet as this address to change settings."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "このアプリについて": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "About This App"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "このアプリについて・ライセンス": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "About & Licenses"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "このアプリは個人情報や利用状況を一切収集しません。ネットワークは、有線 LAN でつないだ LiDAR からデータを受信するためと、あなたが指定したサーバーへ SFTP でファイルを送るためだけに使います。作成したマップや記録はこの %1$@ 内（ファイル App の「この%1$@内 › Mobile SLAM」）に保存され、あなたが SFTP 送信や共有をしたときだけ、その送信先に送られます。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This app does not collect any personal information or usage data. The network is used only to receive data from the LiDAR connected by wired LAN and to send files over SFTP to servers you specify. Maps and recordings are stored on this %1$@ (Files app › On My %1$@ › Mobile SLAM) and are sent only to the destination you choose when you send them via SFTP or share them."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "これより遠い点を使いません。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Points farther than this are not used."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "すべて規定値に戻しますか？": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Reset all to defaults?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "すべて規定値に戻す": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Reset all to defaults"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "まだ保存されたマップがありません。\nマップ作成後に「PCD保存」を押してください。\nPC などから受け取った PCD は「ファイルを開く」で取り込めます。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No saved maps yet.\nAfter mapping, tap “Save PCD”.\nTo import a PCD from a computer or elsewhere, use “Open File”."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "エラー": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Error"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "キャンセル": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cancel"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "キーペア": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Key pair"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "キーペアがありません。SFTP 設定で作成してください。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No key pair. Create one in the SFTP settings."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "キーペアと送信先": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Key pair and destinations"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "キーペアを作り直しますか？": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Regenerate the key pair?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "キーペアを作り直す": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Regenerate key pair"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "キーペアを作成": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Create key pair"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ゲートウェイ": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Gateway"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "コピーしました": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Copied"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "サブネットマスク": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Subnet mask"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "サーバーのホスト鍵が前回と違います。接続先が正しいか確認し、問題なければ接続先の設定でホスト鍵をリセットしてください。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The server's host key differs from last time. Check that this is the right server, and if so, reset the host key in the destination settings."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ジャイロのノイズ": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Gyro noise"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "スキャンとマップ": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Scan and map"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "スキャンの間引き": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Scan downsampling"
          }
        }
      }
    },
