    "タップで表示・左にスワイプか長押しで共有・SFTP 送信・削除\nファイル App の「この%@内 › Mobile SLAM」からも取り出せます": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tap to view. Swipe left or long-press to share, send via SFTP or delete.\nFiles are also in the Files app under \"On My %@ › Mobile SLAM\""
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "タップで選択": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tap to select"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "タップで選択・左にスワイプか長押しで共有・SFTP 送信・削除\n対応: ROS 2 の MCAP（無圧縮・zstd・lz4）。PointCloud2 または Livox CustomMsg と、Imu のトピックを使います。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tap to choose. Swipe left or long-press to share, send via SFTP or delete.\nSupported: ROS 2 MCAP (uncompressed, zstd, lz4) with a PointCloud2 or Livox CustomMsg topic and an Imu topic."
          }
        }
      }
    },
