    "送信先": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Destinations"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "送信先 IP が Mid-360 の IP と同じサブネットにありません。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The destination IP is not on the same subnet as the Mid-360's IP."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "送信先 IP アドレス（この %@）": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Destination IP address (this %@)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "送信先がありません。追加してください。キーペアの作成と公開鍵のコピーは 設定 › SFTP でできます。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No destinations. Add one. Create the key pair and copy the public key in Settings › SFTP."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "送信先だけを変える場合、再起動なしですぐに反映されます。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Changing only the destination takes effect immediately, without a restart."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "送信先を追加": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Add destination"
          }
        }
